sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant H as Route handler
  participant WT as withTenant(orgId, fn)
  participant R as retryTransient
  participant P as appPool (roomly_app)
  participant PG as PostgreSQL

  H->>WT: withTenant(req.auth.orgId, fn)
  WT->>R: attempt 1
  R->>P: borrow connection
  P->>PG: BEGIN
  R->>PG: SELECT set_config('app.org_id', orgId, true)
  Note over PG: is_local = true: setting lives only until COMMIT or ROLLBACK
  R->>PG: fn(tx) queries, e.g. SELECT * FROM rooms
  PG->>PG: RLS appends WHERE org_id = current_org_id()
  PG-->>R: only this tenant's rows
  alt success
    R->>PG: COMMIT
    PG-->>P: connection clean (org id gone)
    R-->>H: result
  else 40P01 deadlock or 40001 serialization failure
    R->>PG: ROLLBACK
    R->>R: sleep random(0..20ms × attempt)
    R->>P: attempt n+1 (max 5), fn re-runs from scratch
  else any other error (23P01, 23505, HttpError...)
    R->>PG: ROLLBACK
    R-->>H: rethrow → caller maps to 409 / 404 / 400
  end
